{"availability":"available","full":"3bdrahman/virtual-assistant-demo","name":"virtual-assistant-demo","description":"Live 3D voice assistant with streamed AI chat and speech.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-25T02:16:30Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:03:19Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://3bdrahman.github.io/virtual-assistant-demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:16.048Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:16.048Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:16.048Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:16.048Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try the live demo · Watch a 12-second voice walkthrough (WebM alternative)","Talk to a live AI through a 3D avatar. Chat text streams into the transcript while complete early phrases are synthesized and played as streamed PCM. The avatar's mouth follows pronunciation estimates refined by audio timing. You can also record a question; transcription starts after recording stops.","The public demo asks for your own NVIDIA API key. It stays in page memory, is sent through the API relay, and disappears on reload. The relay does not use an owner key in this mode. The free API host may take about a minute to wake on a first visit."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/3bdrahman/virtual-assistant-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"37d87383fd6d79fb8a6f285f9ee57c9b2a0c8ea773c701eb4cf4f46f900f74e9","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:16.143Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:16.143Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Try the live demo · Watch a 12-second voice walkthrough (WebM alternative)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/3bdrahman/virtual-assistant-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"37d87383fd6d79fb8a6f285f9ee57c9b2a0c8ea773c701eb4cf4f46f900f74e9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/3bdrah